  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "まわりから　せいでんきを　あつめる。よつんばいの　たいせいで　うちだすビームは　ぜつだいな　いりょく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "주위로부터 정전기를 모은다. 네발로 엎드려서 발사하는 빔은 절대적인 위력을 자랑한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會收集周圍的靜電。以四肢著地的姿勢發射的光束威力驚人無比。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il accumule l’électricité statique alentour. Le rayon qu’il tire quand il se met à quatre pattes est d’une puissance colossale.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es sammelt statische Elektrizität aus der Umgebung. Die Strahlen, die es auf allen Vieren abfeuert, sind extrem stark.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Acumula la electricidad estática de su entorno. El rayo que dispara cuando está a cuatro patas posee una potencia colosal.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Raccoglie elettricità statica dall’ambiente circostante. Quando è a quattro zampe può emettere un raggio di enorme potenza.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It gathers static electricity from its surroundings. The beams it launches when down on all fours are tremendously powerful.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "まわりから　静電気を　集める。四つん這いの　体勢で　撃ち出すビームは　絶大な　威力。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "从周围收集静电。以四肢着地的姿势射出的光束威力极强。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Acumula la electricidad estática de su entorno. El rayo que dispara cuando está a cuatro patas posee una potencia colosal.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "さんちゅうで　あなを　ほり　エサを　さがす。らくばんに　まきこまれてもへっちゃらなくらい　がんじょう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "산속에서 굴을 파며 먹이를 찾는다. 낙반에 휩쓸려도 아무렇지 않을 정도로 튼튼하다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會在山裡挖洞來尋找食物。身體非常堅硬，即使遇到洞穴坍塌也絲毫不會在意。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon creuse dans les montagnes à la recherche de nourriture. Il est si robuste qu’être piégé dans un effondrement le laisse indifférent.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Auf der Suche nach Futter gräbt es in den Bergen Löcher. Es ist so robust, dass es ihm auch nichts ausmacht, wenn diese über ihm einstürzen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Excava hoyos en las montañas para procurarse alimento. Su robustez es tal que apenas se inmuta aunque lo afecte de lleno un derrumbe.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Scava buchi nelle montagne in cerca di cibo. È talmente robusto che non si fa un graffio neanche se viene travolto da una frana.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It digs holes on mountains, searching for food. It’s so durable that being caught in a cave-in won’t faze it.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "山中で　穴を　掘り　エサを　探す。落盤に　巻きこまれてもへっちゃらなくらい　頑丈。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会在山里挖洞寻找食物。身体坚硬，即使遇到塌方也毫无问题。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
